| **~2 weeks** | `V531_` row count and price distribution | far fewer picks than V530_, or all clustered ≥90¢ | Gate 1 or the price floor is now rejecting everything. A model that never bets cannot be validated. |
| **3–7 weeks** | 50 settled `V531_` bets, per-tag | — | only this answers whether it HELPED. |

### FAV V1 checkpoints (independent clock)

| when | check | what failure looks like | if it fails |
